      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Typhoon track warning indicating category 3+ storm heading to grid-vulnerable areas
Frequency: Event-driven per warning
Volume: ~3–5 pre-positioning events annually
Owner: Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Participants: DC Logistics, Store Managers, LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W5180 — Emergency Power Generator &amp; Solar Portable Kit Pre-Positioning</bpmn:documentation>
