      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5180_Task4" name="Identify power-vulnerable stores in the storm path: check historical power…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identify power-vulnerable stores in the storm path: check historical power outage logs and flood zones.
Responsible (R): Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Accountable (A): Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5180_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5180_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5180_Task5" name="Calculate emergency power stock: allocate 5kW-10kW generators for store backup…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Calculate emergency power stock: allocate 5kW-10kW generators for store backup power, and portable 1kW solar generator/battery kits for retail sale.
Responsible (R): Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Accountable (A): Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5180_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5180_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5180_Task6" name="Coordinate fast-track transfer from primary DC to store backrooms; verify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinate fast-track transfer from primary DC to store backrooms; verify pre-positioning is complete 24 hours before landfall.
Responsible (R): Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Accountable (A): Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5180_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5180_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5180_Task7" name="Instruct store LP on security protocols for high-value generator staging zones…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Instruct store LP on security protocols for high-value generator staging zones (VS-23).
Responsible (R): Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Accountable (A): Solar &amp; Renewable Product Manager (VS-70) / Category Buyer
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
