      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5183_Task4" name="Assess inter-island ferry/vessel status in storm path; identify available Ro-Ro…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assess inter-island ferry/vessel status in storm path; identify available Ro-Ro (Roll-on/Roll-off) or container slots.
Responsible (R): Outbound Logistics Manager / Freight Broker (VS-06)
Accountable (A): Outbound Logistics Manager / Freight Broker (VS-06)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5183_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5183_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5183_Task5" name="Negotiate emergency space allocation: secure priority shipping slots for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Negotiate emergency space allocation: secure priority shipping slots for BuildRight relief trucks.
Responsible (R): Outbound Logistics Manager / Freight Broker (VS-06)
Accountable (A): Outbound Logistics Manager / Freight Broker (VS-06)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5183_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5183_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5183_Task6" name="Coordinate port documents: prepare bill of lading, barangay clearance, and LGU…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinate port documents: prepare bill of lading, barangay clearance, and LGU emergency certifications to bypass port queues.
Responsible (R): Outbound Logistics Manager / Freight Broker (VS-06)
Accountable (A): Outbound Logistics Manager / Freight Broker (VS-06)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5183_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5183_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5183_Task7" name="Track container shipment status and coordinate destination port receiving with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Track container shipment status and coordinate destination port receiving with local logistics teams.
Responsible (R): Outbound Logistics Manager / Freight Broker (VS-06)
Accountable (A): Outbound Logistics Manager / Freight Broker (VS-06)
Duration: 1-2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5183_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
