        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-770 (ensure controlled execution — Emergency Material Allocation, Disaster Kit Assembly &amp; Staging Operations (PA-180.1).) | - CTL-770: Driver route plans approved by Fleet Supervisor; satellite check-in schedules established.
Owner: Fleet Planner / Logistics Control Tower Lead (VS-06)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
